      "content": "but there is no rest at the edge. i'm just standing there looking at the drop. it's not like a place to sit down and wait... it feels more like the story has just run out of pages. like the character has reached the final line and there's nothing left to write. it feels almost... inevitable. like the only thing left to do is let go of the path entirely.",
